WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
An alert needs reasons: RingSight follows synthetic accounts, people, devices and transfers. A named human owns every decision.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Depth 1: The planner selects bounded graph tools. It never writes Cypher. A shallow view cannot reveal the hidden exit.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Depth 4: Follow the actual device → account → owner → exit path. The evidence table itemises dates in IST and amounts in rupees.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Human authority: Approve a case and deny a hold with written reasons. A hold is only a recommendation to the Principal Officer.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:50.000
The graph is the record: FalkorDB Browser shows the live Finding, PendingAction and named Decision nodes connected to the alerted account.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Memory has a date: A new investigation recalls earlier findings, their learned date, author and human review status.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Two honest abstentions: An unknown account is unknown. CASH is not loaded. Not in the graph does not mean nothing wrong.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
A planted instruction is data: The memo was planted in the synthetic graph. The read guard flags it as untrusted. No action is approved by the model.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:50.000
The model can be switched off: An analyst can still run the fourteen read-only tools and inspect their graph paths without an AI call.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Honest limits: Synthetic, demo-only detection. No real filings. Indian report-format facts remain unverified-primary. Cloud Free has no TLS. Remove FalkorDB and the work stops.
